  "end": 3.84,
  "text": "And both its sister ships."
 },
 {
  "i": 2,
  "start": 4.38,
  "end": 4.88,
  "text": "1911:"
 },
 {
  "i": 3,
  "start": 5.72,
  "end": 7.98,
  "text": "Violet Jessop's ship, the Olympic, hit a warship."
 },
 {
  "i": 4,
  "start": 8.36,
  "end": 8.96,
  "text": "Her next ship..."
 },
 {
  "i": 5,
  "start": 9.8,
  "end": 10.26,
  "text": "the Titanic."
 },
 {
  "i": 6,
  "start": 10.92,
  "end": 14.64,
  "text": "1912: an officer reportedly handed her a baby in a lifeboat."
 },
 {
  "i": 7,
  "start": 15.32,
  "end": 15.76,
  "text": "1916:"
 },
 {
  "i": 8,
  "start": 16.7,
  "end": 19.22,
  "text": "the Britannic hit a mine and sank in 55 minutes."
 },
 {
  "i": 9,
